# What EAS uploads for an iPhone build. Without this file EAS archives the
# whole repository (1.1 GB with desktop/ and web/), which took ~5 minutes per
# build and twice failed outright at the clone step (build 10, 2026-10-30).
# The iPhone app needs only mobile/: its shared code is generated into
# mobile/lib/shared and committed.
#
# While this file exists EAS ignores every .gitignore, so the secrets and
# build output those files cover are repeated below.

# Everything that is not the iPhone app
/web/
/desktop/
/backend/
/supabase/
/extension/
/photos/
/.claude/
/.github/
/*.py
/*.md

# From the .gitignore files
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
.env
.env.*
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.jks
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/android/
